"Internal Combustion Engine Compressor Model

Piston compressor model with inlet pressure drop and internal leakage.
Operating conditions:
  - Speed: 3000 rpm
  - Inlet temperature: 20 C, pressure: 1 bar
  - Outlet pressure: 4 bar
  - Isentropic efficiency: 0.75
  - Internal leakage flow rate: 10% of total mass flow rate
"

rpm=3000
N=rpm/60
T_su=20
P_su=1E5
P_ex=4E5
epsilon_s=0.75
M_dot_l=0.1*M_dot

"!Relative basis (M_dot = 1)"
M_dot=1

"!Overall compression"
epsilon_s=w_s/w
w_s=h_ex_s-h_su
h_ex_s=ENTHALPY(Air,s=s_su,P=P_ex)
s_su=ENTROPY(Air,T=T_su,P=P_su)
h_su=ENTHALPY(Air,T=T_su)

W_dot=M_dot*w

"!Inlet pressure drop — state su_1"

C_thr^2/2=h_su-h_thr
h_su_1=h_su
h_thr=ENTHALPY(Air,s=s_su,P=P_thr)
P_thr="max(P_su_1,P_crit)"P_su_1
P_crit=(2/(gamma+1))^(gamma/(gamma-1))*P_su
"provisional value:"
"gamma=1.4"
(T_thr+273)/(T_su+273)=(P_thr/P_su)^((gamma-1)/gamma)
T_thr=TEMPERATURE(Air,h=h_thr)

"equivalent nozzle area"
M_dot=V_dot_thr_su/v_thr_su
v_thr_su=VOLUME(Air,T=T_thr,P=P_thr)
V_dot_thr_su=C_thr*A_thr_su
d_su^2/4=A_thr_su/PI

"!Internal isentropic compression"
W_dot=M_dot_in*(h_ex_2-h_su_2)
h_ex_2=ENTHALPY(Air,s=s_su_2,P=P_ex)
s_su_2=ENTROPY(Air,h=h_su_2,P=P_su_2)

P_su_2=P_su_1 "mixing is isobaric; compressor inlet pressure is affected only by the pressure drop, not by leakage"

"displacement volume calculation"
V_dot_su_2=N*V_s
V_dot_su_2=M_dot_in*v_su_2
v_su_2=VOLUME(Air,h=h_su_2,P=P_su_2)

"!Without internal leakage:"
"M_dot=M_dot_in
h_su_1=h_su_2"

"!Accounting for internal leakage:"
"mixing"
M_dot_in=M_dot_l+M_dot
h_su_1*M_dot+h_ex_2*M_dot_l=M_dot_in*h_su_2

"equivalent leakage nozzle"
h_thr_l+C_thr_l^2/2=h_ex_2
h_thr_l=ENTHALPY(Air,s=s_ex_2,P=P_thr_l)
s_ex_2=ENTROPY(Air,T=T_ex_2,P=P_ex)

P_thr_l=max(P_su_1,P_crit_l)
P_crit_l=(2/(gamma_l+1))^(gamma_l/(gamma_l-1))*P_ex
"provisional value:"
"gamma_l=1.4"
(T_thr_l+273)/(T_ex_2+273)=(P_thr/P_ex)^((gamma_l-1)/gamma_l)
T_ex_2=TEMPERATURE(Air,h=h_ex_2)
T_thr_l=TEMPERATURE(Air,h=h_thr_l)
T_su_2=TEMPERATURE(Air,h=h_su_2) "for information only"

"equivalent nozzle area (leakage)"
M_dot_l=V_dot_thr_l/v_thr_l
v_thr_l=VOLUME(Air,T=T_thr_l,P=P_thr_l)
V_dot_thr_l=C_thr_l*A_thr_leak

"!RESULTS"
"1°) INLET PRESSURE DROP:"
"Equivalent nozzle area: A_thr_su=0.00578 [m^2]"
"The fictitious nozzle is not choked (P_su_1>P_crit: P_su_1=84994 > P_crit=52841), nozzle diameter d_su=0.08579 [m]"
"Pressure drop: from 1 bar (P_su=100000) to P_su_1=84994 Pa"

"2°) INTERNAL LEAKAGE"
"Equivalent leakage nozzle area: A_thr_leak=0.0001368 [m^2]"
"Flow is choked at this nozzle (P_crit_l > P_su_1: P_crit_l=233118 > P_su_1=84994)"
"Mixing with leakage raises fresh gas from T_su=20 [C] to T_su_2=37.22 [C]"

